window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>NINE</i></b><i> books for the price of </i><b><i>ONE<br> SEVEN </i></b><i>tattooed possessive billionaires who propose a marriage of convenience<br> </i><b><i>ONE</i></b><i> secret that ties them together</i><br> <br> This is a box set of eight marriage of convenience romances, featuring grumpy, possessive Mafia billionaires who propose a pretend marriage, only to fall for their sunshine fake brides and must grovel to win their hearts, with a grand gesture that will take your breath away!<br> <br> There is banter, forced proximity, one-bed, many arranged marriages, grumpy-sunshine, found family, girlfriends who stand up for you, festive cheer, lots of angst and twists you won't see coming. Also a meddling nonna who plays Cupid. There is no cheating. <b>Binge, </b><b><i>NOW!</i></b><br> <br> Note: This bundle contains<br> <i>Mafia King (Michael &amp; Karma)</i><br> <i>Mafia Queen (Michael &amp; Karma)</i><br> <i>Mafia War (Michael &amp; Karma)</i><br> <i>A Very Mafia Christmas (Christian &amp; Aurora)</i><br> <i>Mafia Crown (Axel &amp; Theresa)</i><br> <i>Mafia Vows (Sebastian &amp; Elsa)</i><br> <i>Mafia Obsession (Luca &amp; Jeanne)</i><br> <i>Mafia Bride (Massimo &amp; Olivia)</i><br> <i>Mafia Lúst (JJ &amp; Lena)</i></p>"; 
